  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/TennisTaulaAdaponda.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En las modalidades de tenis de mesa, que se ha celebrado este s&aacute;bado por la ma&ntilde;ana en el Casal Jove, y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/NatacioAdaponda.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>de nataci&oacute;n, por la tarde en la piscina cubierta.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/1.jpg\" alt=\"1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2188.jpg\" alt=\"img_2188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2189.jpg\" alt=\"img_2189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2192.jpg\" alt=\"img_2192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2194.jpg\" alt=\"img_2194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2195.jpg\" alt=\"img_2195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2196.jpg\" alt=\"img_2196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/activitatsiesportsadapondadecembre/img_2197.jpg\" alt=\"img_2197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439